      "date": "2026-06-17",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
      "notes": "Self-report. EN/DE verbatim. Reverse item: ns4. Part of the Berlin Social Support Scales family. Added official Spanish (soc_s.htm, Varela/Galain/Schwarzer/Schulz 2004), French (soc_f.htm, Schwarzer/Schulz/Katsap 2000), and Polish (soc_pol.htm) translations. NOTE: French source page had NO response anchors — the 4-point French anchors here are implementer-supplied (true-style, matching es/pl), VERIFY. es/fr/pl are the OFFICIAL versions and are gendered (and, for some subscales, assume a female respondent / male patient), unlike the gender-neutral en/de — VERIFY. Added Serbian (Latin; soc … Language_Selection/Serbian; Schwarzer/Schulz/Stula 2003) — official, gendered (masculine self-report)."
    },
